{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_01",
      "hash": "d7ba3467a6083236",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，幹得好！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳戰勝阪木了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_02",
      "hash": "d7ba3367a6083083",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我追著那個叫阿波羅的傢伙\\n到外面一看……\\c\\n整個金黃市的火箭隊隊員\\n一個個都逃跑了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_03",
      "hash": "d7ba3267a6082ed0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還好[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳夠強啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_07",
      "hash": "d7ba3667a608359c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "老實說，我其實\\n是有點害怕的。\\c\\n一直在想要是最強的是\\n那些壞傢伙，那該怎麼辦……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_08",
      "hash": "d7ba3d67a6084181",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能跟[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一起\\n拯救西爾佛真是太好了。\\c\\n這樣一來就不會再有誰碰上\\n像卡拉卡拉那樣的遭遇了吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_04",
      "hash": "d7ba3967a6083ab5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！既然這裡恢復和平了，\\n接下來就繼續我們的道館之旅吧！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳去過[VAR COLOR(0006)]金黃道館[VAR COLOR(0000)]了嗎？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳現在有幾個道館徽章啊？\\r\\n……哦，這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_05",
      "hash": "d7ba3867a6083902",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們該不會已經可以\\n去挑戰寶可夢聯盟了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_06",
      "hash": "d7ba3767a608374f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們都要好好加油喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0960_max",
      "hash": "21d11016938bba32"
    }
  ]
}
